      "extract": "{{ provideVHLDescription.valueMarkdown}} A VHL Holder initiates the Provide VHL transaction when: The VHL Holder wishes to grant access to their health documents to a VHL Receiver The VHL Holder has obtained a valid VHL from a VHL Sharer (via ITI-YY3 Generate VHL transaction) The VHL Holder encounters a VHL Receiver capable of processing VHLs in a relevant healthcare context",
