      "extract": "The VHL payload structure is defined in ITI-YY3 and aligns with the SMART Health Links specification. QR Code Transmission The VHL is transmitted via QR code with the following characteristics: VHL encoded as HCERT QR code with HC1: prefix Suitable for in-person encounters, walk-in clinics, emergency departments QR code contains HCERT/CWT structure with embedded VHL payload Can be displayed on screen or printed on",
