      "extract": "QR Code Characteristics: Can be photographed/copied - use time-limited expiration Suitable for supervised encounters (in-person, on-screen display) Digital signature provides authenticity verification Recommended for higher security scenarios Best Practices: Include short expiration times in CWT exp claim Use passcode protection (P flag) for sensitive data Display QR codes in controlled environments Avoid printing",
