      "extract": "When the VHL is carried as a Verifiable Credential: The DataIntegrityProof SHALL chain to a trust anchor in the trust list (same framework used for CWT/HCERT verification) The VC expirationDate and the VHL payload's exp SHALL both be honored — VHL Receivers SHALL reject if either has passed Confidentiality is equivalent to the QR form: the VC carries the decryption key and MUST be treated as sensitive VHL Sharers",
